# The char carrier under A9's Greater and Lesser. rune is the glyph run the folds and scans
# read; alive scopes it and gone empties it. Nothing here is numeric: a char extremum has no
# identity, so the empty scope has no result row rather than a manufactured glyph.
n 5
col rune char genie
col alive bool 1 1 0 1 1
col gone bool 0 0 0 0 0
ja 印 rune
ja 生存 alive
ja 不在 gone
